	(text "The body is 5.6 mm tall: the front of the robot is lifted by a 7.5 mm skid (lens about 2.3 mm above the floor)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 209.55 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "05337a16-8e55-50aa-b774-03418dbc3866")
	)
	(text "Inside the XIAO: 5V pin -> Schottky -> buck regulator -> 3V3 (3V3 stays up while VBAT > about 4 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 58.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "09bd0f5e-39a7-5384-b21a-244af924c670")
	)
	(text "GPIO15 = yellow user LED on the XIAO (on = 0), a 2nd indicator for free.  BOOT / RESET buttons are on the XIAO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.92 171.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0c7fd4c2-c98d-5332-9b28-e7cb28387d9b")
	)
	(text "4. BUTTON / LED"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "193a963f-dc17-56a4-af56-29d414aaf568")
	)
	(text "IN1/IN2 -> OUT1/OUT2 = LEFT motor,   IN3/IN4 -> OUT3/OUT4 = RIGHT motor (+ = OUT4)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1b2a7b88-925c-5335-ae47-7d607766ad45")
	)
	(text "Power: AA x3 (alkaline 4.5V recommended / NiMH 3.6V) -> VBAT (motors) ; VBAT -> D1 Schottky -> VSYS -> XIAO 5V pin. USB 5V can not back-feed the batteries. Never use 4 cells (the XIAO's 5V input clamps above about 6 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1f3184af-0305-59c5-8e50-b3d328b910a2")
	)
	(text "IR LED: (3.3V - 1.2V - 0.1V) / 100 ohm = about 20 mA each.  Q1 switches all LEDs (ambient light cancel).  Photo transistor: 10k pull-up -> white = low voltage, black = high voltage"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "28656d8c-5edd-5a47-b714-c3fc1f99a9d3")
	)
	(text "2. MCU  Seeed Studio XIAO ESP32C6  (soldered flat, no pin headers)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.92 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2c5ff520-f1e3-51f0-82c1-dd5d8a211001")
	)
	(text "MECHANICAL: H1-H4 = gearbox frame M3 (x30/x70, y62/y96), H5 = front skid M3 (x50, y11: behind the centre sensor)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3b959564-41a2-5399-8cad-5e382adf06f6")
	)
	(text "Insert the plug first and solder the header so that the RED wire is on '+'"
